    dct:description "XML Schema element named (df:xmlSchemaElement): gml:Surface, namespace http://www.opengis.net/gml/3.2, declared in https://schemas.opengis.net/gml/3.2.1/geometryPrimitives.xsd (GML 3.2.1, the version the gml format names since 2026-11-17). Decision of Gérald, 2026-11-17. The realized data type version and the format are unchanged. Classified substantive: the element is the schema of the data type in this format."@en ;
